<title>POLAND: Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish shares close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eleven stocks fell, four rose and four were flat in a 27.5-million-zloty turnover with the WIG 20 index closing at 1,885.7 points, 0.5 percent lower than at the regular session.</p>
<p>The remaining three stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units fell 0.3 percent in a 17.6-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
